{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"民数记","commonName":"民数记","title":"民数记","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"15cf4962220790a4da9d22a145b019d10740b926b3bbffa17ac7fa7978ccb19d","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1272},"chapter":{"number":34,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["迦南地的境界"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华晓谕摩西说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你吩咐以色列人说：你们到了迦南地，就是归你们为业的迦南四境之地，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["南角要从寻的旷野，贴着以东的边界；南界要从盐海东头起，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["绕到亚克拉滨坡的南边，接连到寻，直通到加低斯·巴尼亚的南边，又通到哈萨·亚达，接连到押们，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["从押们转到埃及小河，直通到海为止。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["「西边要以大海为界；这就是你们的西界。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["「北界要从大海起，划到何珥山，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["从何珥山划到哈马口，通到西达达，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["又通到西斐 ，直到哈萨·以难。这要作你们的北界。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["「你们要从哈萨·以难划到示番为东界。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["这界要从示番下到亚延东边的利比拉，又要达到基尼烈湖的东边。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["这界要下到约旦河，通到盐海为止。这四围的边界以内，要作你们的地。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["摩西吩咐以色列人说：「这地就是耶和华吩咐拈阄给九个半支派承受为业的；"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["因为吕便支派和迦得支派按着宗族受了产业，玛拿西半个支派也受了产业。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["这两个半支派已经在耶利哥对面、约旦河东、向日出之地受了产业。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["各支派首领负责分地"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["耶和华晓谕摩西说："]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["「要给你们分地为业之人的名字是祭司以利亚撒和嫩的儿子约书亚。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["又要从每支派中选一个首领帮助他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["这些人的名字：犹大支派有耶孚尼的儿子迦勒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["西缅支派有亚米忽的儿子示母利。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["便雅悯支派有基斯伦的儿子以利达。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["但支派有一个首领，约利的儿子布基。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["约瑟的子孙玛拿西支派有一个首领，以弗的儿子汉聂。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["以法莲支派有一个首领，拾弗但的儿子基母利。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["西布伦支派有一个首领，帕纳的儿子以利撒番。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["以萨迦支派有一个首领，阿散的儿子帕铁。"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["亚设支派有一个首领，示罗米的儿子亚希忽。"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["拿弗他利支派有一个首领，亚米忽的儿子比大黑。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["这些人就是耶和华所吩咐、在迦南地把产业分给以色列人的。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/34.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/35.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/33.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":29}